  message: "DONE on both stated deliverables. Population found (podman-compose, sherpa-onnx + docs/example-claims/generic-taint-claims.yaml); refutation tested and found NOT APPLICABLE, because the premise I pre-registered it on was a misreading of ADR-0046 -- useful precision deducts CONFIGURED-ACTION and KIND-MISDECLARED from the NUMERATOR over the same denominator and does not key on analysis_method. Corrected on this row, on WI-ripas, and in the changelog (b3e66d1936).\n\nNo measured precision regression by any route. Detail in the preceding note.\n\nRESIDUAL FILED SEPARATELY: an actual useful-precision NUMBER still needs per-flow human adjudication via measure-taint-precision.py, and the label-honesty question (not_attempted -> ddg_mixed) is its own owner decision."  # 58e0
